OL,3,GNEWSAWhisky barrel bought for #130 goes
OL,4,Aon sale at #270k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA whisky barrel purchased for #130 is
OL,7,Fto go on sale for #270,000.
OL,9,FSurrey pensioner Angus Kerr said he had
OL,10,Fbought the Glenrothes single malt in
OL,11,F1971 as an investment, hoping it would
OL,12,Fhelp pay for his children's school
OL,13,Ffees.
OL,15,FHe said it was now worth an
OL,16,F"unbelievable" sum, as the barrel was
OL,17,Fthe oldest of its kind known to be in
OL,18,Fexistence.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
