OL,3,GNEWSAWhisky barrel bought for #130 goes
OL,4,Aon sale at #270k
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I don't drink scotch," Kerr said. "If
OL,7,FI did, I would be looking around for
OL,8,Fsomething that was #18, no more. That's
OL,9,Fmy sort of level."
